# Maven build output. The shipped artifact is V71/script/sos-extended-boostables.jar
# (the deploy target the game loads from), which stays tracked on purpose.
#
# Tracking target/ was actively harmful: restoring its .class files with `git checkout`
# gives them mtimes newer than the sources, so maven-compiler-plugin skips recompiling
# and `install` silently re-jars stale bytecode. Never `mvn clean` here (the clean plugin
# is pointed at the project root) — delete target/classes by hand if a rebuild is needed.
target/

# Per-user IDE state. The rest of .idea/ (compiler.xml, misc.xml, vcs.xml,
# Changelog.txt, SteamDesc.bbcode, ...) is shared project config and stays tracked.
.idea/workspace.xml
